            <div class="gs-feature"><span class="gs-feature-check purple">✓</span> Zigbee 3.0 — réseau maillé</div>
            <div class="gs-feature"><span class="gs-feature-check purple">✓</span> Batterie de secours 10 h</div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://daewoo-security.fr/collections/systeme-dalarme-pa501z" class="gs-btn purple-outline">Voir la gamme →</a>
